msgid "Bug fixes:"
msgstr "錯誤修正："

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:65
msgid ""
"A change in GTK 4.14.1 prevented to apply the values inserted into the text "
"field of our SpinButton widgets. This issue is now resolved."
msgstr ""
"GTK 4.14.1 的變更導致無法套用至 SpinButton 小組件文字欄位中輸入的數值。此問題"
"現已修復。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:66
msgid ""
"The latest Maximizer plugin releases do not have the ceiling control "
"anymore. So we removed it from our user interface (you can use the plugin "
"input gain to retrieve the same functionality)."
msgstr ""
"最新版本的Maximizer外掛程式已不再具備上限控制功能。因此我們已從使用者介面移除"
"此功能（您可透過外掛程式的輸入增益來實現相同效果）。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:67
msgid ""
"Equalizer APO import feature does not crash anymore on Flatpak when invalid "
"values are provided."
msgstr ""
"當提供無效數值時，Equalizer APO 的匯入功能在 Flatpak 環境中不再發生當機。"

