msgid "Other notes:"
msgstr "其他註記："

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:69
msgid ""
"In order for Community Presets to be correctly shipped, packagers are "
"invited to read and follow the guidelines linked inside the README of "
"EasyEffects master branch."
msgstr ""
"為了確保社群的預設檔能正確發布，請負責打包人員參閱並遵循 EasyEffects 主分支"
"的 README 文件內連結的指南。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:70
msgid ""
"Presets with Convolver and/or Noise Reduction (RNNoise) effects created "
"before 7.2.0 version are deprecated. Please reload the irs/model file inside "
"the Convolver/RNNoise UI and resave the preset."
msgstr ""
"在 7.2.0 版本之前建立、含有卷積器和/或降噪 (RNNoise) 效果的預設檔已遭廢棄。請"
"重新載入卷積器/降噪介面內的 irs/model 檔案，並重新儲存該預設檔。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:78
msgid ""
"Improved the pipeline management system. Non-limiter effects are placed "
"before the limiter even if the last two plugins in the pipeline are a "
"limiter followed by a level meter."
msgstr ""
"改進了 pipeline 管理系統。即使 pipeline 中最後兩個插件是限幅器接音量計，非限"
"幅效果器仍會置於限幅器之前。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:80
msgid ""
"Fixed a regression that prevented the level meters to be updated under "
"certain conditions."
msgstr "修復了導致等級計量表在特定條件下無法更新的回歸問題。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:89
msgid ""
"We now set monitor.passthrough = true in our virtual devices. This will "
"allow latency offset to be properly applied by video players when PipeWire "
"&gt; 1.0.3 is released."
msgstr ""
"我們現在在虛擬裝置中設定 monitor.passthrough = true。此設定將使當 PipeWire 版"
"本高於 1.0.3 時，視訊播放器能正確套用延遲偏移量。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:90
#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:237
msgid "Updated translations."
msgstr "已經更新翻譯。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:100
msgid ""
"EasyEffects will try to avoid moving to its virtual sources streams for "
"which the user has set a custom target.object that is different from the mic "
"EE is recording from. THe stream has to be started when EE is already "
"running for this logic to take effect."
msgstr ""
"EasyEffects 會盡量避免將那些使用者已設定自訂 target.object（且該設定與 EE 正"
"在錄製的麥克風不同）的虛擬音源串流進行轉移。此邏輯要生效，必須在 EE 已經運行"
"時才啟動該串流。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:101
#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:115
#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:126
#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:301
#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:396
#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:522
msgid "Updated translations"
msgstr "已經更新的翻譯"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:102
msgid "The equalizer can export basic APO preset files"
msgstr "等化器可以匯出基本 APO 預設集檔案"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:103
msgid ""
"Our players/recorders tab will show the audio client binary name in the "
"cases were no app name is defined."
msgstr ""
"在未定義應用程式名稱的情況下，「播放器／錄音機」分頁將顯示音訊客戶端二進位檔"
"的名稱。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:104
msgid ""
"EasyEffects version can be shown in the command line through the option --"
"version"
msgstr "EasyEffects 版本編號可以在指令列加上選項 --version 進行顯示"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:106
msgid ""
"A workaround for a bug in gtk4 GtkLevelBar was implemented and will be kept "
"in place until gtk developers fiz things on their side"
msgstr ""
"針對 gtk4 GtkLevelBar 中的錯誤已實作了一項暫行解決方案，該方案將維持有效，直"
"到 gtk 開發人員在他們那邊解決問題為止"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:117
msgid ""
"Fixed a regression introduced in 7.1.2 that could cause EasyEffects to crash"
msgstr ""
"修復了在 7.1.2 版本中引入的回歸問題，該問題可能導致 EasyEffects 發生崩潰"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:128
msgid "The DeepFilterNet plugin can now be added to the preset file"
msgstr "DeepFilterNet 外掛現在可以被加入至預設集檔案"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:137
msgid ""
"The spectrum has a new option that allows the dynamic vertical scale to be "
"disabled."
msgstr "波形圖有一個新的選項，允許停用動態垂直尺度。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:138
msgid "Improved compatibility with the latest LSP releases."
msgstr "增強與最新 LSP 程式的相容性。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:140
msgid "Fixed an incorrect drawing of the impulse response file characteristics"
msgstr "修復脈衝響應 (Impulse) 錯誤的波形圖"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:150
msgid ""
"Fixed a small bug the prevented the noise reduction voice activity threshold "
"from being properly initialized."
msgstr "修復降噪擴充對人聲感測門檻被錯誤地初始化。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:159
msgid ""
"Added a new control to the noise reduction plugin that allows the voice "
"detection to be disabled."
msgstr "降噪插件增加新的控制功能允許停用語音偵測。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:169
msgid ""
"The Filter effect has been improved with new parameters since it has been "
"ported from Calf Studio to Linux Studio Plugins."
msgstr ""
"自從「Filter」效果從 Calf Studio 移植到 Linux Studio Plugins 以來，其功能已透"
"過新增的參數獲得強化。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:170
msgid ""
"Noise reduction by RNNoise has been improved with the addition of Release "
"and VAD Threshold controls."
msgstr "RNNoise 的降噪功能已透過新增「釋放」與「VAD 閾值」控制項而得到改善。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:171
msgid ""
"Noise reduction by RNNoise can now mix the original and denoised signals to "
"avoid the output to sound too \"dry\"."
msgstr ""
"RNNoise 的降噪功能現可將原始訊號與降噪後的訊號進行混音，以避免輸出音效聽起來"
"過於「乾澀」。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:174
msgid ""
"This release is intended to work with versions of Linux Studio Plugins equal "
"or greater than \"1.2.10\"."
msgstr "此版本旨在與 Linux Studio Plugins 1.2.10 版或更高版本搭配使用。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:175
msgid "EasyEffects is now buildable also with libc++."
msgstr "EasyEffects 現已支援使用 libc++ 進行構建了。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:183
msgid "The Expander from Linux Studio Plugins can be used in Easy Effects."
msgstr "Linux Studio Plugins 推出的「Expander」可於 Easy Effects 中使用。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:184
msgid ""
"The Equalizer bands now have an additional gain control that allows for more "
"efficient input of values that are hard to set in the scale. More details at "
"issue 1383."
msgstr ""
"等化器頻段現已新增一個增益控制，可更有效地輸入那些在刻度上難以設定的數值。更"
"多詳情請參閱問題 Issue #1383。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:185
msgid ""
"Added the ability to select and load multiple files in the opening dialogs "
"for presets, Convolver impulse responses and RNNoise models."
msgstr ""
"在預設值、Convolver 衝激響應及 RNNoise 模型的開啟對話方塊中，新增了選取並載入"
"多個檔案的功能。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:187
msgid "Fixed the Solo button in the Equalizer band settings."
msgstr "修正了等化器頻段設定中的「Solo」按鈕。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:189
msgid ""
"Easy Effects folders under /etc have been deprecated and presets located "
"there won't be loaded anymore. At the moment only local presets under "
"~/.config/easyeffects are automatically loaded in the Presets Menu. In the "
"future we will implement a new system to install, manage and import "
"Community Presets."
msgstr ""
"位於 /etc 目錄下的 Easy Effects 資料夾已不再支援，該處的預設值將不再被載入。"
"目前僅有位於 ~/.config/easyeffects 下的本機預設值會自動載入至「預設值」選單"
"中。未來我們將實作一套新的系統，用於安裝、管理及匯入社群預設值。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:197
msgid ""
"An \"Experimental Features\" section was added to our preferences window."
msgstr "我們在偏好設定視窗中新增了一個「實驗性功能」區段。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:198
msgid ""
"The native window of the LSP plugins can be used. This is an experimental "
"feature intended only for advanced users. So expect some bugs."
msgstr ""
"可以使用 LSP 外掛程式的原生視窗。這是一項實驗性功能，僅供進階使用者使用。因此"
"可能會出現一些錯誤。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:199
msgid "Fractional semitone values can now be used in the Pitch Shift effect."
msgstr "現在可以在音高效果中使用分數半音值。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:201
msgid ""
"The input/output device dropdown in our PipeWire tab is updated when the "
"system default device changes and Use Default is enabled. This fixes issue "
"issue 1989."
msgstr ""
"當系統預設裝置變更且已啟用「使用預設」選項時，我們「PipeWire」分頁中的輸入／"
"輸出裝置下拉選單便會更新。此更新已修復 Issue #1989。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:210
msgid "A new Level Meter plugin based on libebur128 has been added."
msgstr "已新增一個基於 libebur128 的新音量計外掛程式。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:211
msgid ""
"The Pitch plugin now uses the library SoundTouch instead of Rubberband. "
"Hopefully some of the mysterious crashes that were happening with Rubbernand "
"are not going to happen anymore."
msgstr ""
"The Pitch外掛程式現在改用 SoundTouch 函式庫，取代了 Rubberband。希望先前使用 "
"Rubberband 時發生的一些原因不明的當機問題，今後不再發生。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:212
msgid ""
"Improved compatibility with recent PipeWire versions. More information at"
msgstr "改進了與目前 PipeWire 版本的相容性。更多資訊見於"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:214
msgid ""
"Active Equalizer filters are not set to Bell type anymore when the number of "
"bands changes."
msgstr "當頻段數量發生變化時，主動式等化器濾波器將不再設定為鐘形。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:216
msgid ""
"Rabberband is not a dependency anymore since it has been replaced by "
"SoundTouch."
msgstr "Rabberband 已不再是依賴項，因為它已被 SoundTouch 取代。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:224
msgid ""
"The presets menu now asks for confirmation before saving/deleting a preset "
"file."
msgstr "預設選單現在會在儲存或刪除預設值檔案前，要求使用者確認。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:226
msgid "The plugin reset should not make its controls innefective anymore."
msgstr "重新設定外掛程式後，其控制項不應再失效。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:228
msgid ""
"Speex is no longer incorrectly listed as a build dependency (speexdsp is "
"still a build dependency)"
msgstr "Speex 已不再被錯誤地列為建置依賴項（speexdsp 仍是建置依賴項）"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:229
msgid ""
"RNNoise is no longer an autodependency. It is now required by default, if "
"not available it must be explicitly disabled with -Denable-rnnoise=false"
msgstr ""
"RNNoise 已不再是自動依賴項。現在它預設為必備，若無法取得，則必須透過 "
"-Denable-rnnoise=false 明確停用。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:239
msgid ""
"A small mistake was done in the last release. Making a new one to make sure "
"people have the right branch in the package"
msgstr ""
"上個版本中出現了一個小錯誤。因此發布新版本，以確保使用者能從套件中取得正確的"
"分支。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:247
msgid ""
"The Equalizer \"sort bands\" feature is now ordering bands on GSettings, so "
"the result can be saved into presets."
msgstr ""
"等化器的「頻段排序」功能現已可在 GSettings 中對頻段進行排序，因此排序結果可儲"
"存至預設組中。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:248
msgid "Improved performance when resetting keys."
msgstr "重設金鑰時的效能已獲得改善。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:250
msgid ""
"Fixed the \"Large Empty Hall\" preset selection in the Reverberation effect."
msgstr "修正了混響效果中的「大型空曠廳堂」預設選項。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:251
msgid ""
"Fixed some misuses of PipeWire's API that can potentially fix some random "
"bugs some users are facing."
msgstr ""
"修正了 PipeWire API 的一些錯誤用法，這可能有助於解決部分使用者所面臨的某些隨"
"機錯誤。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:253
msgid ""
"As we are removing code deprecated by GTK 4.10 the minimum GTK version has "
"been increased."
msgstr ""
"由於我們正在移除 GTK 4.10 中已標記為過時的程式碼，因此最低 GTK 版本要求已提"
"高。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:261
msgid ""
"The spectrum plugin update rate was improved. Different sampling rates "
"should lead to similar update frequencies visually."
msgstr ""
"頻譜外掛程式的更新速率已獲得改善。不同的取樣率應能呈現出視覺上相似的更新頻"
"率。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:262
msgid ""
"The update interval used by level meters and the spectrum can be customized "
"by the user."
msgstr "電平表和頻譜所使用的更新間隔可由使用者自行設定。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:263
msgid ""
"The equalizer band gain slider value can be updated in larger steps. Fine "
"grain control is still possible through the keyboard up/down keys."
msgstr ""
"均衡器的頻段增益滑桿數值可透過較大的步長進行調整。若需精細控制，仍可透過鍵盤"
"上的上/下方向鍵來操作。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:264
msgid "Small improvements to the echo canceller."
msgstr "對回聲消除器進行了些微改進。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:266
msgid ""
"The echo canceller probes were not being linked to the soundcard after the "
"move to multiple filters intances. This should be fixed now."
msgstr ""
"在改用多個濾波器實例後，回聲消除器的探針未能與音效卡建立連結。此問題現已修"
"復。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:274
msgid ""
"It is now possible to add more than one filter instance to the effects "
"pipeline."
msgstr "現在已經可以將多個濾鏡實例加入效果處理流程中。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:275
msgid ""
"A new Speech Processor plugin based on the Speex library was added. Besides "
"providing noise suppression it also can detect voice activity. It is a "
"decent alternative to the cases whre the rnnoise library does not work well."
msgstr ""
"新增了一個基於 Speex 函式庫的語音處理器外掛程式。除了提供雜訊抑制功能外，它還"
"能偵測語音活動。當 rnnoise 函式庫無法正常運作時，這是一個不錯的替代方案。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:276
msgid "Improved compatibility with Linux Studio Plugins 1.2.3."
msgstr "提升了與 Linux Studio Plugins 1.2.3 的相容性。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:277
msgid "GraphicEQ presets can be imported into the Equalizer effect."
msgstr "GraphicEQ 的預設值可匯入均衡器效果中。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:278
msgid ""
"The application name has been changed to Easy Effects to adhere to the "
"naming conventions of GNOME Human Interface Guidelines."
msgstr ""
"為符合 GNOME 人機介面指南 的命名規範，該應用程式名稱已變更為 Easy Effects。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:279
msgid "The documentation has been updated."
msgstr "文件已經更新了。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:280
msgid "Improved presets autoloading."
msgstr "改進了預設值的自動載入功能。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:281
msgid "The Autogain silence threshold can now be configured by the user."
msgstr "使用者現在可以自行設定自動增益的靜音閾值。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:282
msgid "Dry and wet controls added to the Stereo Tools effect."
msgstr "已將乾濕訊號控制項新增至 Stereo Tools 效果器中。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:283
msgid ""
"The echo canceller now has a residual noise suppression control also based "
"on the Speex library."
msgstr "回聲消除器現在也具備了一項基於 Speex 函式庫的殘餘雜訊抑制控制功能。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:285
msgid ""
"When the mouse was hovering over a chart the wrong value for the x axis "
"coordinate was being shown. This regression is fixed."
msgstr "當滑鼠懸停在圖表上時，顯示的 x 軸座標值不正確。此回歸問題已修復。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:287
msgid ""
"Because of the new multiple instances feature, the preset format has "
"changed, but the old one is still compatible to be loaded. Anyway take in "
"consideration that saving the current preset will always write it in the new "
"format."
msgstr ""
"由於新增了多重實例功能，預設檔的格式已有所變更，但舊版格式仍可相容並載入。無"
"論如何，請注意：儲存當前預設檔時，系統將始終以新格式儲存。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:295
msgid ""
"Multiband Gate implementation has been migrated from CALF to Linux Studio "
"Plugins."
msgstr "多頻段閘門實作已從 CALF 遷移至 Linux Studio Plugins。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:296
msgid ""
"The preset autoloading code compatibility with bluez5 devices has been "
"improved."
msgstr "預設自動載入程式碼與 bluez5 裝置的相容性已獲得改善。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:297
#, fuzzy
msgid "Wet/dry controls were added for some plugins"
msgstr "Wet/dry controls were added for some plugins"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:298
msgid ""
"Effect interface is no longer loaded when the related lv2 plugin is not "
"installed on the system. In its place a status message to the user is shown."
msgstr ""
"當系統上未安裝相關的 lv2 外掛程式時，效果介面將不再載入。取而代之的是，系統會"
"向使用者顯示一則狀態訊息。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:299
msgid "The documentation has been updated"
msgstr "文件已經更新"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:300
msgid "Improved debug messages"
msgstr "增進除錯訊息"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:311
msgid "Improved translations"
msgstr "改進的翻譯"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:313
msgid ""
"Fixed a bug where EasyEffects could crash when closing its window while "
"effects were being applied."
msgstr ""
"修復了一個錯誤，該錯誤會導致在套用特效時關閉 EasyEffects 視窗，進而造成程式當"
"機。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:322
msgid ""
"The bypass state can be saved to the preset file. The reasons why this was "
"done can be seen at issue 1039"
msgstr "繞過狀態可儲存至預設檔中。此設計的理由請參閱 Issue 1039"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:323
msgid ""
"The preset autoloading code compatibility with usb devices has been improved."
msgstr "預設的自動載入程式碼與 USB 裝置的相容性已獲得改善。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:324
msgid ""
"A dialog is shown to the user when a preset fails to load or a preset/"
"impulse file fails to be imported."
msgstr ""
"當預設檔無法載入，或預設檔／脈衝檔無法匯入時，系統會向使用者顯示一個對話方"
"塊。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:325
msgid ""
"The SideChain Gate plugin from Linux Studio Plugins is now used instead of "
"the one from Calf Studio."
msgstr ""
"現在改用 Linux Studio Plugins 推出的 SideChain Gate 外掛程式，取代原先來自 "
"Calf Studio 的版本。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:327
msgid ""
"EasyEffects should not crash anymore when the user locale is not properly "
"configured."
msgstr "當使用者地區設定未正確設定時，EasyEffects 應不會再發生當機情況。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:328
msgid ""
"A workaround was implemented in our icon to deal with the lack of proper SVG "
"support in QT."
msgstr "由於 QT 缺乏對 SVG 的適當支援，我們在圖示中實作了臨時解決方案。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:337
msgid ""
"When effects are disable to an application we now set its target metadata to "
"null. This will allow the media session manager (wireplumber) to properly "
"move the stream to a new device."
msgstr ""
"當應用程式的效果被停用時，我們現在會將其目標元資料設為 null。此舉將使媒體會話"
"管理員（wireplumber）能夠正確地將串流移轉至新裝置。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:338
msgid ""
"A new configuration option was added. It allows EasyEffects to ignore "
"streams whose purpose is to monitor sink devices. This will help to fix some "
"of problems our users were having when using OBS."
msgstr ""
"新增了一項設定選項。此選項可讓 EasyEffects 忽略那些用於監控輸出裝置的串流。這"
"將有助於解決使用者在使用 OBS 時所遇到的部分問題。"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:339
msgid "The code that shows the stream sample format has been improved"
msgstr "展示串流樣本格式的程式碼已進行優化"

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:340
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The rnnoise library is now optional. This should help package maintainers to "
"build a Debian package. See issue 1000 for more information."
msgstr ""
"The rnnoise library is now optional. This should help package maintainers to "
"build a Debian package. See issue 1000 for more information."

#: data/com.github.wwmm.easyeffects.metainfo.xml.in:341
